      -CurrentGroundOverrides @{boot=[uint64]241;rf22=[uint64]21} `
      -PreviousVehicleQ 13 -CurrentVehicleQ 14 `
      -PreviousGroundQ 11 -CurrentGroundQ 12 `
      -PreviousVehicleMs 144389 -CurrentVehicleMs 149169 `
